WEBVTT

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.880
Part of the Trinary Solar System, the Purple Planet...

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.890
Zonder Metal was originally developed by intelligent life-forms to...

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.130
...eliminate stress wavelengths, or "Negative Emotions".

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.390
But over time, the very program running this Zonder Metal...

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.560
...began to spin out of control.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.000
And countless planets...

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.040
...began to die out like cells under attack by some pathogen.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.250
Both the Green and Red Planets are on the brink of destruction.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:44.110
However...

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.790
It is on these very planets that the antibodies...

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.300
...capable of defeating the pathogen were born.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:05.070
And both of these antibodies have descended to the Blue Planet.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.950
They are the vaccine for protecting the life-form known as outer space.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.810
And here they wait for their time to come.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.290
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:01.890
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:06.810
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.040
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:17.130
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:21.830
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.790
It's time to launch!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.970
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:32.890
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:37.590
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.550
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.470
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.220
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.730
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:53.400
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:55.260 --> 00:03:00.930
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:06.930
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.750
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.930
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:17.810
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:20.790
A Distant Victory Song

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.570
<i>A Distant Victory Song</i>

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.350
At the Gutsy Galaxy Guard...

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:35.860
...the worst crisis known to mankind continues.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.930
The Machine Primevals in human form have fused with battleships.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.630
With their powers enhanced, they are poised to attack the Orbit Base.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:53.410
Meanwhile, what will become of the boy, Kaidou...

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.310
...now trapped inside the Intestine Primeval's ship?

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.010
We're going to counter-attack!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:02.540
Division III, Susanoh! Division IV, Amaterasu! Rapid Launch!

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.120
We're going to meet the Primeval Ships head-on in battle!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.320
The GGG Mobile Unit will take its position on Amaterasu...

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.660
...and use it as a fortress!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.460
The enemy battleships are approaching at top speed.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.190
They're going to attack us!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.990
Protect Shade System, launch!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.230
It's no good!

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.400
The secondary Power Reactor won't be able to recharge in time!

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:21.170
What did you say?

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.830
We won't get a full charge for another 14 minutes!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.680
If it means we can build our Zonder Metal Plant...

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:30.980
...then we have no other choice!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.450
Let's pulverize them in one blow!

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.750
Atomic Disassembly!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.690
The enemy's approaching!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:43.560
So you came, J-Ark!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.800
J, if we don't rescue Arma...

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.390
...we cannot possibly achieve our objective!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.030
You don't have to tell me.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.300
The 31 Zonder Crystals...

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:58.470
In other words, destroying the Master program was always our goal.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.700
I know that only too well.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.880
Fusion!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.780
J-Rider Mode!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.260
Double Plasma Sword!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.530
Attack!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.960
Too slow, too slow! Far too slow for me!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.740
It's attacking the Primeval Ships?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:28.160
They're trying to save Kaidou!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.440
Are you talking about that red-haired boy?

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.480
Yes!

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.970
The Primeval Ships are just as much our enemy as theirs.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.340
All right!

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:40.540
From here on in, GGG will commit all of its power to support the J-Ark!

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.680
Prepare to confront the Primevals!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.750
Both Susanoh and Amaterasu...

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.120
...are to head for the battlefield area at maximum speed!

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:00.330
Fusion!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.040
GaiGar!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.350
Mamoru! What are you...

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.150
I'm a GGG member too!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.780
Mamoru...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.690
All right! Let's fight together, then!

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.120
Okay!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.430
Program Drive!

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.560
Final Fusion!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.870
The Space Booster...

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.740
A special device that has made it possible for GaoGaiGar to go into...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.140
...prolonged battle in outer space!

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:49.120
GaoGaiGar!

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.880
Reverse!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.630
Did you just regenerate?

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.160
Have you forgotten what my special power was?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.060
Projected route of the enemy ship, 10583!

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.640
Your actions have already been anticipated!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.150
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.020
Maser Missile!

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.420
How amusing.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.650
Why don't you show me the power of your Anti-Primeval Weapons!

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.760
Who thought he'd attack us head-on?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:39.860
Mocking the Ultimate Seven Machine Primevals, I see!

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.530
Come on, let's smash him to pieces!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.800
Phantom Ring!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.500
Plus!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.920
Broken Phantom!

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:04.660
There's a hole in my body!

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:07.400
I don't believe it!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:11.370
How could it go through the Primeval's barrier system so easily?

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:13.560
I've got your back, J-Der!

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:17.260
How many times do I have to tell you? This battle is mine to fight.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:18.540
No need to butt in!

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:22.050
Are you out of your mind? This is just as much a battle for Earth!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.710
How can I just leave it up to you?

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.980
GGG Mobile Unit! Keep an eye on where that white battleship's heading!

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.420
Marg Cannon!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:40.690
Shuang Tou Long!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.930
FF Mirror, radiate!

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.740
Reflector Beam, launch!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.960
I'm going to shred you to pieces!

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.960
Reflector Beam, launch!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:21.700
What's going on here?

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:26.140
Enemy ship maneuvering at top speed. Unable to predict the beam's angle!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.010
Nice going, Volfogg!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.310
As long as we have Susanoh covering for us...

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.890
You don't have a prayer of defeating us with such a low-level attack.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:45.530
Your fate was already decided long ago, on that Red Planet.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.690
In other words, death!

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.830
J-Der, Plug Out!

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.160
Plasma Wing!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:56.870
No!

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:58.080
Is he going for...

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:58.840
...the liver?

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.510
Plasma Sword!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.480
Curse you!

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:09.680
J-Quath!

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.090
J!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.630
Curatio!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.030
Teneritas!

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.570
Sectio!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.170
Salus!

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.930
Coctura!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:41.720
What's this?

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.620
Just as we thought, they fused with human beings!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.250
You can hold onto that crystal for us.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.950
The enemy has lost its power to regenerate instantly.

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.400
We're going to put them away!

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.060
Gotcha!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.590
G and J.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.330
Green and red.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.400
The Legacy of Cain and the Curse of Abel.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.300
Joining forces in battle...

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.230
Absolute Danger Rate...

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.010
...infinite!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.120
I see you're anxious about the battle going on outside.

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:22.090
But in any event, as long as the J-Jewel Absolute Barrier stands...

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.320
...there's nothing you can do.

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.090
Are you okay, Mamoru?

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.130
Yeah!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:28.890
Here we go!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.970
Mega-Fusion!

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:57.660
King J-Der!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.530
Just because you killed Liver, you think you have the upper hand?

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:06.660
Take a look at that!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.410
Is Arma in there?

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.380
Let's go!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.780
Primeval Fusion!

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:21.650
Don't tell me...

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:22.850
The Primevals...

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.320
Combined?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:40.130
Like EI-01. No, it's an even bigger monster!

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.320
They combined!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.120
It's huge!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.040
Here comes the impact!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.970
The ES System is fully recharged now!

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:18.880
Turn on the Protect Shade!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:25.610
It's not deflecting!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.980
It's all they can do to stand their ground!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:55.970
No good. Apparently I unleashed a bit too much power.

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.140
There'd be no point in wiping out all of mankind...

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.910
...when we need them to serve as Zonder hosts.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.720
Unbelievable power...

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.720
It won't be easy to get close to him now!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:07.620
What should we do?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.560
Can you hear me, Gai?

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:16.720
Is that you, Mikoto?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.770
You're to retreat now. We're launching an all-out Solitary Wave attack!

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:21.960
That means...

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:23.630
The Mic Brigade!

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.940
System Change!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.020
Mic Sounders!

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:44.950
Disc X, Anti-Primeval Core Mix Reissue version has been burned!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.390
All machines, fall into formation!

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.470
All right! Disc X, load!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:56.200
Disc X, set on!

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:02.110
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:08.280
Acoustic Field Oscillator, Maximum Output Feedback, start!

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:11.680
Spatial orientation! Energy excitation! Generate Solitons!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.490
Solitary Wave Riser, launch!

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:24.860
Did he get him?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.770
Atomic Disassembly!

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:30.470
Black Hole!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.470
Not a scratch on him!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:36.970
Oh, my God!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.210
The Solitary Wave had no effect!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.180
But it worked when they were in human form!

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:53.330
Unbelievable! Because they fused together, the increased energy...

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.460
...from Atomic Disassembly actually created a barrier...

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.520
...to protect them against the Solitary Wave Riser!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.430
A shield able to neutralize even the Solitary Wave?

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:03.870
Come back here, J!

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.540
Antimeson Cannons!

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:11.410
At that level, you can't even reach my barrier.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.220
Then I'll fire my ES Missiles!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.390
Behind me, 271!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:31.900
As a combination of Arm, Eyes, Ears, Nails, Intestines, and Ribs...

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.900
...I now have six different powers at my disposal!

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.840
5-Linked Maser Cannons!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.700
Atomic Disassembly!

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.170
Black Hole!

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:45.850
I told you it was futile, didn't I?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.250
J-Quath!

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:56.780
Impossible!

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.420
The Curse left by Abel...

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.370
...shall now be subjected to Atomic Disassembly.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:13.080
It's no good, I can't move either.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.740
Broken Phantom!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:18.810
Out of my way!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.490
Protect Wall!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.400
GaoGaiGar has sustained damage to his engine!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:39.200
That's not good! Now he'll only be able to fight for another 10 minutes!

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.800
I can no longer control Susanoh!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.640
Our SP Pack's been hit! We can't move!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:49.110
Damn! My Ul-Tech Engine can't take me to the moon!

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:52.550
It's going to take some time to recharge!

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:53.910
Captain!

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.080
Isn't there... isn't there some way out of this?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.450
Legacy of Cain, you may sit back and wait there.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:05.490
Since I'll be disposing of the Curse of Abel first...

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.760
Big Brother Gai! You've got to do something or King J-Der's gonna...

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:15.640
I know, but how can I win if even the Solitary Wave doesn't work on him?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.010
It's you!

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.560
You just became...

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.460
...one.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.450
I get it now!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.360
Chief!

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.300
Is that you, Gai?

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.230
I want you to launch the Gatling Driver!

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:45.670
We don't have much time. I'm just gonna go for broke!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:49.070
All right! Gatling Driver, emergency launch!

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:02.910
Mic! All 13 of you are going to gather your strength into one!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.450
I need you to unleash that Solitary Wave now!

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:08.010
Oh, but we can't do that right now.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.580
It feels like we're going to explode into pieces!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.560
Gatling Driver!

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.030
Hey! My brothers!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.140
We're supposed to be heroes! Let's try to make it on sheer guts!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.670
Number 13...

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:23.810
Okay!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:24.740
Let's give it a shot!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.300
Let's save GaoGaiGar!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.440
Rock 'n' roll will never die!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:30.600
Bend space!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.550
Solitary Wave...

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.350
...fire!

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.590
Create Gravity Lens!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:52.970
Come on!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:53.700
Come on!

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:54.400
Come on!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:58.230
Pierce it!

00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.700
How ridiculous.

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:01.900
Even if I don't regenerate in time...

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:05.440
...I can still send you into eternal darkness through the Black Hole!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.580
I won't let that happen! Trapping me was a big mistake!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:18.190
Did you just reverse the flow of the J-Jewel Absolute Barrier?

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.390
This is the moment I've been waiting for! J-Quath!

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:31.040
The Gatling Driver has warped space...

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:32.370
...creating a Gravity Lens...

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.610
...and allowing the Solitary Wave to focus on a single point.

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.700
The pulsing waves entering the Primeval...

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.770
...have spread throughout its entire body, stripping it of all its powers!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:49.520
5-Linked Maser Cannons! Antimeson Cannons! Simultaneous Barrage!

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:02.160
Kaidou!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:05.940
Awesome!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.670
I wanna take a picture of that!

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.270
You really are simple-minded, you know that?

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.310
Mamoru...

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:17.210
Hana?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:28.360
What's that?

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.930
J, so you survived.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:35.900
Kaidou...

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.800
We did it, baby.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.340
Templum...

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:45.080
Mundus...

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.510
Infini...

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:47.980
Tum...

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.680
Redire!

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:05.000
Four of them... meaning we let two escape?

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:07.960
Mother...

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:20.680
The Ultimate Seven Primevals, dismantled.

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:24.810
In this way, the Ultimate Seven Primevals...

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.550
...fell in battle to GGG, King J-Der, and young Kaidou.

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:34.060
The perpetual quest to live on...

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:36.400
So long as we never forget this...

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:40.370
...the day that we hear the distant victory song can't be too far off.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.170 --> 00:23:48.040
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:50.870
The 31 Machine Primevals are striking back!

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:53.370
Both GaoGaiGar and King J-Der have been sealed...

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:56.240
...leaving only GekiRyuJin to meet them in battle!

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:59.150
Now that its combat forces have been divided...

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:02.710
...does GGG have a chance of defeating the 4 attacking Primevals?

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:05.420
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:06.960
"Return from an Ancient Era"

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:06.160
Return from an Ancient Era

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:09.990
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:14.890
ChoRyuJin

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.430
This is the Key to Victory!
